In a very unexpected twist

My web-based port of Quake 1 (powered by FTE) at https://t.co/uckE83TUzM has become one of the most popular servers in the QuakeWorld community

@dsvensson messaged me and asked me to add some missing features like WebRTC and QTV so people can watch https://t.co/01hiwxbF3c

